<InfoPage title="About Playbox AI Video Guide" kicker="About this publication" description="An independent editorial guide to Playbox AI image-to-video generation, templates, credits, consent, privacy, and alternatives."><h2>Our purpose</h2><p>We help adults understand what to test before uploading a photo or paying for an AI video tool. Coverage focuses on motion consistency, prompt control, source rights, credits, output duration, privacy, deletion, disclosure, and meaningful differences between products.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>This is not the official Playbox product website. Official links are clearly marked and open the provider’s own site. Features, prices, policies, and availability can change, so readers should verify current details before uploading or purchasing.</p><h2>Editorial approach</h2><p>Every article answers a specific production or safety question, uses an original comparison framework, identifies uncertainty, links to primary sources, and displays publication and update dates. We never request private source images for review.</p></InfoPage>
